---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Stroke Rehabilitation in Faridabad | Neriva Health" 
    description="Dedicated neurological and stroke rehabilitation in Faridabad. We help patients regain mobility, balance, and independence."
>
    <section class="section-padding" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-blue);">Stroke & Neurological Rehabilitation</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--text-light); max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                Recovering from a stroke or managing a neurological condition requires patience, specialized knowledge, and consistent therapy. Our goal is to help you maximize your independence and quality of life.
            </p>

            <div style="background: var(--bg-light); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our Neuro-Rehab Focus</h2>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8;">
                    <li><strong>Stroke Recovery:</strong> Regaining motor control and neuroplasticity training.</li>
                    <li><strong>Paralysis & Weakness:</strong> Targeted exercises to improve muscle firing and tone management.</li>
                    <li><strong>Balance & Coordination:</strong> Fall prevention and gait re-education.</li>
                    <li><strong>Functional Independence:</strong> Training for daily activities like walking and transferring.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Need Assistance at Home?</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-light);">We provide home visits across Faridabad for neurological patients who cannot travel.</p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/919650940281?text=Hi,%20I'm%20inquiring%20about%20stroke%20rehabilitation." target="_blank" class="btn btn-accent" style="margin-right: 1rem;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
            <a href="tel:9650940281" class="btn btn-primary">Call Clinic</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
